Funding-Text = {This paper is my interpretation of a decades-long discussion with
   colleagues and friends, especially Jim Acheson, Ted Ames, Bob Steneck,
   Yong Chen, Robin Alden, and Spencer Apollonio; with the always skeptical
   biologists in my family, Karen Wilson, Theo Willis, and Carl Wilson; and
